{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月13日，微軟執行副總裁查爾斯·拉曼納（Charles Lamanna）在社交平台X發文，就Microsoft 365大範圍服務故障造成的影響致歉。他表示，微軟正在處理相關問題，目前沒有跡象表明此次故障由惡意活動或網絡攻擊引發。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586232.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T06:37:10.898211+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T06:28:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T06:30:31.235611+00:00","content_hash":"f8e908f64238ad58be388faff7bc3da352632e7eb7a63a772c94263137746dae","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}